    "### Goal:\n",
    "In this lab, you will connect to the eye tracker, collect gaze data, \n",
    "and save it for later analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "You will learn:\n",
    "- how to access gaze data from the eye tracker\n",
    "- how to store data over time\n",
    "- how to export data for analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Task 1 — Connect to the Eye Tracker\n",
    "\n",
    "### Objective:\n",
    "Verify that your system can detect and connect to the eye tracker.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Instructions:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Import the Tobii SDK\n",
    "2. Find available eye trackers\n",
    "3. Print the model name\n",
    "\n",
    "### Observe:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Is the eye tracker detected?\n",
    "- What happens if no tracker is connected?\n"
   ]
  },
